    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36986" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pompo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1,
				v. a., <i>to make</i> or <i>do</i> any thing <i>with pomp</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">grandisonis pompare modis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sedul. 1, 2</span></i>
			.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pompātus</span></b> , a, um, P.
			a., <i>magnificently ordered</i>, <i>pompous</i>, <i>splendid</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pompatior suggestus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Spect. 7</span></i>
			.</div>
